      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The study involved 85 patients with coronary heart disease (CHD). The parameters of metabolic status the actual food intake with the help of a new computer program, based on frequency method were investigated from patients with cardiovascular diseases. It was found a disbalanse of intake main food components and low physical activity in of patients."},
